  "term": "TRH",
  "definition": "TRH is a peptide found throughout the central nervous system and in peripheral tissues. In this source, TRH signaling in neurons of the dorsal vagal complex is described as an important part of brain-gut communication, and TRH-related peptides are linked with neuroprotective and other body-wide effects.",
